WEBVTT

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:39.050
Thank you very much!

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:21.880
What?

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:23.340
Something you want?

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:28.920
What's gotten into them?

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:41.680
Poka~n 15

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:40.690
Tonight's Spell Is a Vampire!

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:22.720
What's that?

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:29.230
Oh, it's that...

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:32.560
Wait!

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:38.880
It was just...

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:40.090
It definitely...

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:44.420
Hey, Pachira, you there?

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:45.440
Hey!

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:48.930
What are you being so loud about, Liru-san?

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:51.130
You're so noisy...

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:52.300
Hey, where's Pachira?

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:53.500
Have you seen her around?

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:54.370
What?

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.840
Oh, there you are.

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:58.300
What about me?

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.880
Pachira, where have you been until just now?

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.130
Um, what?

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:07.120
Why? Why does it matter?

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:08.240
Why do you ask?

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.810
Weren't you just at the alleyway next to the shine?

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:12.960
The shrine?

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:17.530
Huh? I wasn't at a place like that.

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:18.840
Really?

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:20.680
Really!

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:22.320
I wouldn't lie to you!

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:25.340
Hey, hey, what're you talkin' about?

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:28.800
Just now, I saw someone lying on the street who had their blood sucked.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.160
I saw someone running away from the scene, too.

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:35.000
I've been telling you, that wasn't me!

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:36.700
But it looked like you, Pachira.

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:37.690
What?

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:41.820
It's not me! I wasn't somewhere like that!

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.220
Then what were you doing out?

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:47.170
Um...

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:50.180
I was at the convenience store for a little...

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.350
But you aren't carrying anything.

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:55.560
Um... that's because... um...

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.630
I was just browsing.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.360
I really like reading!

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:01.820
It looked just like you, Pachira.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:03.150
Jeez!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:05.370
It wasn't me, I'm telling you!

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:06.940
You're so damn persistent!

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:10.850
I know that it'd be a problem for all of us if we were forced to leave,

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:13.640
So I've been holding out on sucking blood, you know that!

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:15.880
What! What is it?!

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.560
I don't like your attitude.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:18.800
Move!

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:27.780
Liru-san, you said too much.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:31.020
But, I really saw her.

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:32.130
Oh yeah!

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:35.850
Now that ya mention it, Jun and Tan said they saw the same thing last night!

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:37.960
See?

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:41.860
But, deciding it just like that...

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:23.600
She sure has some nerve.

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:26.180
Maybe it won't come out tonight!

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:42.880
That's all for you.

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:45.880
Slowly and calmly get up, and prepare to come with me!

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:48.290
Hey, wait!

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:54.820
It disappeared...

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:12.230
Everyone, we're having a meeting!

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:13.950
Get out here!

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.080
What is it?

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.400
Is it morning?

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:23.960
Night?

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:25.750
I'll say this clearly.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:28.860
The culprit isn't me.

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:30.680
That's all I know.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:33.360
Really?

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:35.720
There was another victim tonight.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:40.120
We have no choice but to capture the real criminal.

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:41.690
As soon as possible.

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:43.710
I guess I can believe you.

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:44.930
Of course!

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:46.970
Pay attention!

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:02.610
I'm sleepy, but...

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:06.180
Ow....

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.580
I don't like being the bait...

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:14.340
What would happen if it seriously wounded me, Liru-san?

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:21.650
Well, come out from wherever you are, culprit!

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:23.770
I'll get you for sure.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:35.160
Please, let nothing happen. Let nothing happen.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:37.720
Scaring me can't be that enjoyable!

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.790
I'm not tasty!

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:46.780
Could it be... it's appeared?

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.220
Is that it?

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.210
This isn't good!

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:53.460
This is serious!

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:55.800
Liru-san, Pachira-san!

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:58.800
Uma-san, it's here!

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:00.810
Hurry up!

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:04.100
Hurry!

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.210
You're under arrest.

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:26.170
Oh, does this immobilize you?

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:31.660
Everyone, I've caught it!

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:32.840
Everyone!

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:34.760
Hm?

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.440
You guys are so mean sometimes.

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:42.810
Lying and saying you'd protect me.

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:52.820
So, let me get this straight.

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:56.820
When your space ship crash landed, your mother was injured.

00:09:57.380 --> 00:10:00.480
She didn't have enough blood, so you were collecting blood for her?

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:05.290
Wasn't there some other way?

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.300
Well, how much more do you need?

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:17.300
We can help you guys out, if we're enough.

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:21.570
Pachira-san!

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:45.050
I'm so glad...

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:47.600
Really, I'm so glad!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:52.700
G-good for you.

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:02.800
Don't forget your bag.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.140
Thank you very much!

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:05.340
Yup!

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:12.540
Oh yeah...

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:15.170
The customer wearing a bat on her head...

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:17.220
She didn't come today.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.360
That's odd.

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:58.440
Black Loincloth Mohawk

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:57.750
Delivery Service

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:55.660
Hello!

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:58.440
Black Mohawk Delivery Service here!

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:03.410
Pokaan ~ 16

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:03.060
The Spell of Dreams is magic that lasts only one day.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:07.450
Black Loincloth Mohawk

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:07.450
Delivery Service

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.060
What is it, what is it?

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:07.450
What came?

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:11.020
It's something I won in an "Netherworld Teen" contest!

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:17.220
I was hoping to win a USB external hard drive, so I entered the contest.

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:19.960
Isn't that a small box for that kind of prize?

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:23.590
Now that you mention it...

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:24.330
Happy
Chalk

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.860
No matter how you look at it, this isn't a hard disk.

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:33.850
It's not an expansion chip, either.

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:37.540
Um... Happy Chalk.

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:41.490
If you draw with this, it seems as though whatever you draw will become real.

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:42.200
What?

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.170
Really?

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:44.370
Seriously?

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.890
Hey, I was first! Give it over!

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:49.890
No, I was!

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:50.090
Give it to me!

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:51.760
Please! Please wait a second!

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:53.780
Don't recklessly use it!

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:56.540
That's something I won!

00:12:57.150 --> 00:12:59.170
Ai-chan, you're so selfish!

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:00.760
Don't be selfish!

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:02.220
All princesses are created equally!

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:02.510
What?

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:04.680
So, what'll we draw?

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:06.570
Hm... two more!

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:07.510
Okay!

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.510
W-wait!

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:15.520
You know... What happens if what we draw becomes real down to every last detail?

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:19.410
Do you have the confidence to draw it exactly as it exists?

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:21.540
Can you draw the lines exactly as you see them?

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:25.240
What'll you do if it becomes something nasty?

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:30.290
Let's do a test run!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.540
I'm included in this?

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:42.050
Guess it was a good idea to have everyone draw beforehand!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:44.280
You're one to talk!

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:46.550
Here.

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:49.490
Then, master artist, please do the honors.

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:52.050
Okay.

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:57.520
You know...

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:01.600
It looks like if you can't use magic, this won't work.

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:03.410
What?

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:06.530
I'm the one who won it, though!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:11.580
So why does it have to be Uma-san?

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:15.640
Maybe you can summarize the image in words!

00:14:15.610 --> 00:14:18.500
Just be as concise as possible.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.540
Oh!

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.580
A tall, good-
looking man

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:37.730
After all, words are just words.

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:45.540
But, Pachi-chan, it seems like this is a good man!

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:46.930
Really?

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:49.410
No, no, there's no way.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.650
Really?

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.530
Aw shucks...

00:15:02.530 --> 00:15:06.050
It's embarrassing to say it, but this is kinda nice too!

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:12.940
Hey, if just words work this well, maybe even a bad drawing will be even better than this!

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:14.360
Okay, Uma!

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:15.300
Time to draw!

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:18.560
Try to mimic Aiko's drawing and draw!

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:23.880
Just copy it as well as you can!

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:26.240
Do your best, Uma, our master artist!

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:27.880
I'm done!

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:35.910
Do it to scale! Scale!

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.930
Fine then, whatever.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.920
I tried so hard to draw it!

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.770
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:47.820
Please forgive this philistine for being unable to appreciate the work of such a masterful artist!

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:49.350
It's wonderful!

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:50.920
Extraordinary!

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:52.930
Well...

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.720
I don't know if it's THAT good...

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:57.650
That was really just some trash I threw on the page.

00:15:57.650 --> 00:15:58.950
Surely, you jest!

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:00.540
How modest of you!

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:06.610
If there's something you want me to draw, don't hesitate to let me know.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.760
Oh, okay!

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:11.740
Please, draw the Galaxy Express!

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:15.770
Umm... I believe that if I board the Galaxy Express and go to Andromeda,

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:18.520
I'll be able to receive a body of flesh and bone!

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:19.750
Please!

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:21.490
The Galaxy Express?

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:23.420
I've never seen it...

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:24.930
Was there one in the netherworld?

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:28.750
I heard rumors about it when I was in the Ariake neighborhood of Akihabara.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:32.570
If it doesn't come true unless Uma-san draws it,

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:34.760
I have no choice but to ask her.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:39.770
I... I... want this more than anything else in the world!

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:41.570
I...

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:43.030
Ai-chan, let's go!

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:44.300
To Andromeda!

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:46.520
C'mon, let's go outside.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:49.300
It's too small to draw a train in here.

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:56.580
So what's the Galaxy Express like?

00:16:56.580 --> 00:17:00.010
I'm sorry... I've only heard rumors of it.

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:02.850
Then, I'll just draw what I think it'll look like!

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:04.100
Hm, what?

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:05.070
Nothing,

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:06.350
Go ahead, master!

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:08.500
Please, draw it to your image!

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:12.940
This time, keep size in mind, master!

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:14.410
I got it!

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:16.520
You worry too much, Pachi-chan!

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:20.100
Don't forget doors and windows, master!

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.600
I told you, I got it!

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:22.680
Don't forget wheels, okay?

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:26.480
I humbly apologize.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.890
Please continue, master.

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:46.730
Okay, let's get on!

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:47.720
Okay!

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:59.050
Okay then, let's take off to Andromeda!

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.260
Okay!

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:19.030
Wow, this is amazing!

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:31.260
I never even imagined I'd be able to take a trip into space!

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:32.700
I know!

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:34.810
My heart is still thumping!

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:38.760
So, how long until we get to Andromeda?

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:39.530
I dunno.

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:41.220
"I dunno"?

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.570
Well, it's not something you should be concerned with, right?

00:18:43.570 --> 00:18:45.330
We'll get there when we get there!

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:47.390
But, in the manual, it said...

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:52.210
Uma!

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:54.500
Do something to make this thing go faster!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:55.810
...Do something...?

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:59.540
Anything is fine, but we need to get there in a day!

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:01.440
We won't be able to go back to Earth otherwise!

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.270
"Able to get home
in one day"-Speed

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:37.380
Andromeda Galaxy, Andromeda Galaxy.

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:43.160
Please, double check to make certain you have not left any valuables on the train.

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:47.220
It seems like we've made it...

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:49.140
Thank goodness.

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:50.450
I guess...

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:53.980
Hello everyone!

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:58.170
Please proceed forward to get your body transformed!

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:21.300
Um... Is this...

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:25.620
Where I have my body turned into a human one?

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:27.660
Yes, this is it.

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:34.120
Well then, please specify here what body type, gender, and age you would like.

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.210
Okay!

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:38.880
In exchange, it will take about a day of your time.

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:39.940
What?

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:42.290
One day?

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.550
Is there a problem, ma'am?

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:48.300
Um, does it take a day no matter what?

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:51.560
Is there a way to make it a half day, or a few hours?

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:55.140
I can't be here for that long.

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:56.560
Isn't there some way...?

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:59.320
I'm very sorry,

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:02.570
But it takes the same amount of time for everyone.

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:07.660
I'm sorry, but is there no way you can extend your visit?

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:11.680
No, there isn't.

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:14.530
I see.

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:17.980
Then, we will await your return at another time.

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:30.490
Okay, let's go home.

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:45.480
Why do you wear that silly thing anyway, Pachi-chan?

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:47.790
Oh, shut up!

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:49.890
It makes me look more grown up!

00:21:52.090 --> 00:21:53.420
They were true...

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:57.000
The rumors were true!

00:21:59.700 --> 00:22:01.140
Some day...

00:22:01.140 --> 00:22:02.210
I'll definitely...

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:44.230
Next Pokaan···

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:40.890
There's things like flashing your panties or flashing your bra, right?

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:42.900
They're panties! They're bras!

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:43.980
Is that okay?

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:46.650
Well, you don't go full out and hold them out there, right?

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:49.370
What's with that?
